<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S3 Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S3 Inc.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist upgraded S3 Inc to a strong buy and raised its near term price target to $21.  </p>
<p>-- Estimated July was stronger than expected as inventories have beggun to come into balance.</p>
<p>-- Leaving estimates unchanged.</p>
</text>
